{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:256","content":{"id":256,"title":"38 免疫系统太激进：过敏","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"203f55f0-086f-4c45-8d07-e7e3cefd1ed5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"埃博拉病毒，感染了也要 6 天才会死，而过敏发作，15 分钟就会没命。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79cd4af2-53d9-4f9e-8a44-20ca6b9ce72e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过度意味着免疫系统对不怎么危险的东西产生了大规模过度反应。就像是在房子里发现一只虫子，然后动用了核武器把整个城市夷为平地，虫子消灭了，城市也没了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a639b8e-889f-43b4-8714-96966561e17f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引发过敏的抗原是无害物质的分子，叫过敏原，可以被适应性免疫细胞和抗体识别。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1af517e7-0027-49df-9500-990bf686e42a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"超敏反应分为两步："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"269bac74-bc79-4c14-9ffa-9c4991e80183","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ddc7cd2f-a767-405b-a57b-9f577583df57","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"da33da90-cca2-484e-b3e0-01aca04c3a42","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"初遇过敏原"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"89908520-c9d2-4656-8ab1-a3127d6a398a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一次过敏原进入体内，可与之结合的 B 细胞被激活了，B 细胞生成针对性的 IgE 抗体，IgE 抗体不是问题，几天就代谢了，问题是肥大细胞擅长和 IgE 抗体结合，肥大细胞表面的受体很容易和 IgE 抗体结合，肥大细胞表面的抗体几周甚至数月都不会分解。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"197bd163-587d-41d0-8a20-496d75030152","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肥大细胞可以释放组胺快速引发炎症反应。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f9eeca0e-0cd8-44d8-bd5a-0f3d47cea833","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a553538-c967-4ddd-9261-5f4d0ee57d26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"再次接触"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4af21eac-120f-41b9-a462-8c7cf2f0a11f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过敏原后续再次进入体内时，肥大细胞会脱颗粒，把内部所有能促进炎症的化学物质都吐出来，造成了不舒服的过敏症状，引发血管收缩，液体渗入组织，导致发热、红肿，全身不适。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a639e4fe-040a-4c6d-837a-bcb8a59e16d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果太多部分同时发生过敏反应，可能会导致血压严重下降，这一点足以致命。同时组胺会刺激生成黏液和细胞，平滑肌收缩，让人呼吸困难。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"77b11024-5dc9-4f9a-af84-a3ec94669630","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"肥大细胞脱颗粒后，会释放细胞因子，导致嗜碱性粒细胞聚集过来，它也能和 IgE 抗体结合，它能确保过敏反应不会很快消退。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db14d078-b7d0-4f8e-be1f-9140b62e3fb1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"嗜酸性粒细胞会被肥大细胞和嗜碱性粒细胞释放的细胞因子激活，喷出一堆刺激性物质，本意是为了消灭敌人，但是却误伤了自己。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ec3f0ced-7bae-42f2-8140-be4860c65e6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IgE 抗体本是为了对付大型寄生生物的超级武器（巨噬细胞，中性粒细胞吞不下体积太大的寄生物）。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"38 免疫系统太激进：过敏","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:256","type":"doc","id":256}}],"prevPage":{"title":"37 免疫系统太弱：HIV 和艾滋病","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:247","type":"doc","id":247}},"nextPage":{"title":"39 免疫系统可能想念寄生虫","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:257","type":"doc","id":257}},"createTime":1741908599152,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}